<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 26-week T-note yield falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 26-week T-note yield falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   4.930	 4.92-4.93   4.935</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 56)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   4.838	 4.81-4.85   4.850</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 43)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
